admin":false},"body":"The prior random-input controls cannot establish deterministic effect prediction. This candidate preserves those historical controls and adds a separate finite software profile: freeze 10,248 C90-model outcomes in the original native Ledger, independently read them through the original Terminal, then compare native optimized C, Python and an explicitly selected M68000/QEMU execution. The optional Lake/Lean path checks actual emitted state bytes against the existing formal model and requires rejection of a changed observation.\n\nThe candidate adds no production executor, actuator or wire-state change. It binds source, conditions, compiler/target/flags/binaries and pinned emulator/Lean tools. Native conformance passes; final source-wide and emulator/kernel validation are in progress and no pending proof is claimed complete. Full results and bound evidence will be attached to this draft.\n\nMain integration, independent-host witness/time evidence, productive native operation and exact-domain delivery remain open. No speedup, physical-effect proof, compiler/emulator correctness or EFFECT_ACK_DONE is claimed.\n\nRequirements and authorization: Ingolf Lohmann. Implementation and technical verification: OpenAI Codex.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-23T23:57:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:09:03Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"5147bb361371b3537b6731bc5ebc34ecdcf96d52","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ingolf-lohmann:test/m68000-deterministic-prediction-20261024","ref":"test/m68000-deterministic-prediction-20261024","repo":{"id":1273784147,"node_id":"R_kgDOS-xnUw","name":"qik-vrt","full_name":"ingolf-lohmann/qik-vrt","owner":{"login":"ingolf-lohmann","id":294949349,"node_id":"U_kgDOEZSR5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/294949349?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingolf-lohmann